## What to deliver

Build the plow sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — a long, hard-edged tracked snow plow facing right, filling the
96x32 canvas, with a steel chassis on caterpillar treads, a tall hazard-yellow plow
blade at its leading edge, a glass-windowed cab, and a red warning beacon, in the
industrial palette on full transparency. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded
`actions.json` is your finished submission.
